### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@authToken = your_auth_token_here
@tenantId = 1

### 1. List Lessons
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. List Lessons by Student
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/2/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. List Lessons by Instructor
GET {{baseUrl}}/instructors/1/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Schedule a New Lesson
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "student_id": 2,
    "wallet_id": 1,
    "scheduled_at": "2026-09-28T14:00:00Z",
    "duration_minutes": 50,
    "notes": "Aula prática no percurso de exame"
}

### 5. Show Single Lesson
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Update Scheduled Lesson
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "duration_minutes": 100,
    "notes": "Aula dupla de baliza e garagem"
}

### 7. Complete Lesson & Debit Hours from Wallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "hours_consumed": 1.00,
    "notes": "Aula concluída com sucesso. Aluno dominou baliza de 2 pontos."
}

### 8. Cancel Lesson
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Delete Lesson (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json
